OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 27 APR
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GSoweto Kinch is back with another
OL,12,     Gweek of the best in jazz from the
OL,13,     GUK and around the world, and he
OL,14,     Gwelcomes bassist Rosa Brunello as
OL,15,     Ghis Flowers guest.
OL,16,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,17,     GFabian Muller plays Beethoven's
OL,18,     Gthird piano concerto with the
OL,19,     GGerman Symphony Orchestra,
OL,20,     GBerlin. Also, Emilie Mayer's
OL,21,     GOverture to Faust and Beethoven's
OL,22,     GSymphony no 2.
